DESCRIPTION:BlueWallet 8.0.1 | BlueWallet_8.0.1_1784575843\n\n### New Featu
 res\n\niOS 26 Liquid Glass design\nImport Unchained JSON as a multisig cos
 igner\nSupport BC-UR v2 air-gap scanning for hardware wallets (OneKey\, Ke
 ystone)\nOption to redact push notification content\nArkade Lightning push
  notifications\nEnable RBF for single-sig watch-only wallets (HD Bech32)\n
 Human-readable data on transaction status screen\n19 new languages\, inclu
 ding Filipino\, Armenian\, Akan\, and Sesotho\n\n### Improvements\n\nRenew
 ed Settings UI\nBetter green success color contrast\nRemoved GroundControl
  server URL option from notification settings\nFaster transaction fetching
  for HD wallets\nReplaced crypto-js with modern @noble crypto libraries\n\
 n### Fixes\n\nStartup crash\nAmount input lag in RBF custom fee input\nTex
 t size on main app views and clipped wallet balance in carousel\nQR codes 
 no longer have rounded corners\nSigned transaction hex screen stays scroll
 able\nArkade LNURL payment result now persists\nFloating button no longer 
 overlaps the transaction list\nVarious modal and navigation UX polish\n\nU
 nder the hood: dependency updates\, TypeScript coverage improvements\, CI 
 and translation tooling fixes.\n\n## What's Changed\n* FIX: startup crash 
